IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Un regalo da parte di {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Mmmh, perché mai vorrebbe darmi
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non che mi lamenti.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
A me piacciono tutti i regali!

ES:
¿Así que entregaron un paquete
para mí{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} en casa de {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Veo que no soy el único despistado.
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}¿Pero por qué está abierto?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¿Has sido tú?{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
¡Lo siento!
A mí no me mires...

TRANSLATION:
Paketim {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}yanlışlıkla {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}} tarafına{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
gitmiş demek. Ama neden
açılmış? {{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Bu kısmı biraz {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
tuhaf... Ben {{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Üzgünüm!
Bana bakma...

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Das ist ja das, was {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}
für mich besorgen sollte!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Das ging
ja fix!
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Auf {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}} kann man sich
wirklich verlassen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aber...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}} Guck mal!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Die Verpackung ist ja aufgerissen!{{TAG:000F:0000:00000000}}
Äh, weißt du...
Guck doch nicht so!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Bulunmasına çok sevindim.
Teslimat için sağ ol! {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}
sayesinde{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} geri döndü, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡¡¡Oye!!!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Seremos muy amigos,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡pero eso ha sido un detalle
feísimo por tu parte!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Come on now!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} We might be tight,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
but that doesn't give you the right
to open my mail!

{{TAG:0003:001B:}}But at least you were honest about
it.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} That counts for something.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
So I guess I'll forgive you.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Al menos has sido sincer{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Algo es algo, supongo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Así que te perdonaré.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Aber wenigstens hast du es gleich
zugegeben, das ist schon mal was.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ausnahmsweise verzeih ich dir!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Così mi hai rovinato la gioia
di aprire il pacco{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}. Che delusione.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ma non serve a niente arrabbiarsi.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Per questa volta...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ti perdono!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}And, hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} since I'm such a nice guy,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'll still give you a thank-you gift
for the delivery,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} et comme je suis un mec sympa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
je te donne une petite récompense
pour ta peine,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Guarda,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} visto che sono gentile,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ti faccio pure un regalo per avermi
portato il pacco,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Und guck mal, wie nett ich bin!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich schenk dir sogar noch was als
Dankeschön,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
